{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日2回目の更新失礼。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/04/5209360/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに欅ちゃんたちと\nたくさん写メ撮れたアアアア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りかちゃん、ななこちゃん\n鈴本ちゃん、尾関ちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい撮ったよ！幸せだよ！\n欅ヲタと名乗っていいですか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/04/5209360/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菅井ちゃん♡\n菅井ちゃん家のトムにゃんにも\n会ってみたいなあ( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだあるので\n少しずつ載せていくね( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜個握ありがとうございました～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/04/5209360/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース:yuni\n靴:moonstar"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースは最近買ったお気に入り！\n清楚に見えるけど\nポロシャツの素材で、\nいつも通りカジュアルファッション！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目の個握がラストでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルは初めてのアンダー2列目で\n握手の部数も過去最高で\n完売も過去最高でたくさんの方と\nお話できて幸せでした。本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目のレーンが発表されて\n部数が減ってしまっていたのが\nうーん、悲しいけど...\nみなさんと会える時間が長くなるよう\nまた頑張っていこうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wピース！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/04/5209360/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川さんの卒業セレモニー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいみんの皆様の\n愛がたっぷりこもったセレモニー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても感動しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツのデザイン\nセンス良すぎるーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りエコパの卒業コンサートまで\nたくさん想い出作りたいなあ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/06/04/5209360/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}